        "outdated": false
      },
      {
        "key": "section.product.rz.json.principal.d2.contenido:noop9mzx3ndv",
        "value": "<ul><li><strong>Óleo de alecrim</strong></li><li><strong>Óleo de hortelã-pimenta</strong></li><li><strong>Óleo de amêndoa doce</strong></li><li>Óleos vegetais de girassol, argão, cânhamo, azeite e abacate</li></ul><p><strong>COSMOS ORGANIC</strong> certificado pela ECOCERT Greenlife · 100% de origem natural · 69% biológico · Vegano · Fabricado na UE.</p><p><strong>INCI:</strong> Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil*, Decyl Cocoate, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil*, Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis (Sweet Almond) Oil*, Argania Spinosa (Argan) Kernel Oil*, Parfum/Fragrance, Cannabis Sativa (Hemp) Seed Oil*, Olea Europaea (Olive) Fruit Oil*, Persea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil*, Mentha Piperita (Peppermint) Oil*, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Oil*, Urtica Dioica (Nettle) Leaf Extract*, Menthol**, Limonene**, Camphor**, Pinene**, Citrus Aurantium Bergamia Peel Oil, Linalool**, Beta-Caryophyllene**, Vanillin, Linalyl Acetate**, Eugenia Caryophyllus Oil, Eugenol**, Citrus Aurantium Peel Oil, Citrus Limon Peel Oil, Pogostemon Cablin Oil, Santalol**, Coumarin**, Carvone**.</p><p>*Ingredientes de agricultura biológica. **Provenientes de óleos essenciais naturais.</p>",
        "outdated": false
